This project builds on Kronos, a foundation model for financial candlesticks.

    Kronos — https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 ShiYu

The upstream model code is NOT vendored here: `kpaths.py` locates a separate
Kronos checkout at `$KRONOS_UPSTREAM` or next to these packages (see INSTALL.md).

Two files reproduce upstream code, with the changes noted in their docstrings:

  kronos_pretrain/model_ext.py   reproduces Kronos.forward and decode_s1 with one
                                 added line, so that a (market, frequency) bucket
                                 embedding can be injected.
  kronos_post/backbone.py        reproduces Kronos.forward up to the final norm,
                                 to read hidden states instead of generated bars.

